
title: Teysa
---
<<declare $metTeysa = false>>
<<declare $teysaAdmiredIslands = false>>
<<declare $teysaAppleQuestStarted = false>>
<<declare $teysaAppleQuestComplete = false>>
<<declare $teysaPositiveInteractionUnlocked = false>>
<<declare $teysaPositiveInteractionSeen = false>>
<<if $metTeysa == false>>
    Teysa: Wow...
    Teysa: Even from here, you can see all those islands floating in the distance.
    Teysa: It's almost like someone scattered pieces of the world across the sky.
    {$playerName}: Enjoying the view?
    Teysa: Ah!
    Teysa: Oh! Sorry, I didn't hear you coming.
    Teysa: I was a little distracted.
    {$playerName}: I can see that.
    Teysa: Can you blame me?
    Teysa: Look at those islands!
    Teysa: The way the light falls across them...
    Teysa: It's beautiful, isn't it?
    -> It really is beautiful
        {$playerName}: Yeah. It's one of the most beautiful things I've ever seen.
        Teysa: You think so too?
        Teysa: I'm glad!
        Teysa: I was beginning to think I was the only one who could appreciate something like this.
        <<set $teysaAdmiredIslands = true>>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterteysa" 5>>
        Teysa: It's nice having someone to share the view with.
    -> It's strange more than beautiful
        {$playerName}: It's certainly strange. I don't think I've ever seen anything like it.
        Teysa: That's fair.
        Teysa: I suppose something can be both strange and beautiful.
    -> We should focus on finding a way out
        {$playerName}: It looks impressive, but shouldn't we be figuring out how to leave?
        Teysa: Oh...
        Teysa: You're right, of course.
        Teysa: I suppose I got a little carried away.
    Teysa: Oh! Where are my manners?
    Teysa: My name is Teysa.
    Teysa: Though some people call me the Child of the Void.
    {$playerName}: Child of the Void?
    Teysa: It's a rather dramatic title, isn't it?
    Teysa: I didn't exactly choose it.
    Teysa: People tend to give names to things they don't understand.
    {$playerName}: What do you mean?
    Teysa: It's... a long story.
    Teysa: Maybe I'll tell you sometime.
    {$playerName}: What do you do?
    Teysa: I'm an alchemist!
    Teysa: I make potions, study unusual materials, and occasionally create exploding items.
    {$playerName}: Occasionally?
    Teysa: Well...
    Teysa: More often than I'd like to admit.
    {$playerName}: Sounds dangerous.
    Teysa: Only when something goes wrong!
    Teysa: Which is why I always try to be careful.
    Teysa: Anyway, I've been studying the surroundings since I woke up here.
    Teysa: The floating islands don't seem to behave like anything I've encountered before.
    Teysa: I'd love to investigate them properly.
    Teysa: Although...
    {$playerName}: Something wrong?
    Teysa: Um...
    Teysa: This is a little embarrassing, but...
    Teysa: *Grrrr...*
    {$playerName}: Was that your stomach?
    Teysa: ...
    Teysa: Unfortunately, yes.
    Teysa: I've been so distracted by the view that I completely forgot to eat.
    Teysa: I don't suppose you've seen any food around here?
    {$playerName}: Not much. What are you looking for?
    Teysa: Nothing fancy.
    Teysa: An apple would be lovely, actually.
    Teysa: Would you mind bringing me one if you happen to find it?
    -> Of course, I'll find you an apple
        {$playerName}: Sure. I'll see what I can find.
        Teysa: Really?
        Teysa: Thank you!
        Teysa: That's very kind of you.
        <<set $teysaAppleQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "teysa_apple">>
    -> I'll see what I can do
        {$playerName}: I'll keep an eye out, but I can't promise anything.
        Teysa: That's alright!
        Teysa: I appreciate you considering it.
        <<set $teysaAppleQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "teysa_apple">>
    -> Not right now
        {$playerName}: Sorry, I've got other things to do.
        Teysa: Oh, that's alright.
        Teysa: I'll manage somehow.
    <<set $metTeysa = true>>
<<else>>
    <<jump TeysaReturn>>
<<endif>>
===

title: TeysaReturn
---
<<if $teysaAppleQuestComplete == true>>
    <<jump TeysaRelationship>>
<<elseif $teysaAppleQuestStarted == false>>
    Teysa: Oh! Hello again, {$playerName}.
    Teysa: It's nice to see you.
    Teysa: I don't suppose you've reconsidered helping me find something to eat?
    -> I'll bring you an apple
        {$playerName}: Sure. I'll get you an apple.
        Teysa: Really? Thank you!
        <<set $teysaAppleQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "teysa_apple">>
    -> Maybe later
        {$playerName}: Maybe later.
        Teysa: That's alright.
        Teysa: I'll be here admiring the view.
<<elseif has_item("apple")>>
    Teysa: Oh! {$playerName}, you're back!
    {$playerName}: I found something for you.
    Teysa: Is that an apple?
    Teysa: It looks wonderful!
    -> Give Teysa the Apple
        {$playerName}: Here. You looked like you needed it.
        Teysa: Really? For me?
        {$playerName}: Of course.
        <<remove_item GameManager "apple">>
        <<set $teysaAppleQuestComplete = true>>
        <<complete_quest QuestManager "teysa_apple">>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterteysa" 10>>
        Teysa: Thank you so much!
        Teysa: You have no idea how hungry I was.
        Teysa: *Crunch!*
        Teysa: Mmm!
        Teysa: That's much better.
        {$playerName}: Glad I could help.
        Teysa: You know...
        Teysa: Most people don't usually go out of their way to help me.
        {$playerName}: Why not?
        Teysa: Oh, it's nothing.
        Teysa: People can be a little... uncomfortable around me.
        {$playerName}: Well, I'm not.
        Teysa: ...
        Teysa: That's nice to hear.
        <<if $teysaAdmiredIslands == true>>
            <<if $teysaAdmiredIslands == true && $teysaAppleQuestComplete == true && get_affection("characterteysa") >= 10>>
            <<set $teysaPositiveInteractionUnlocked = true>>
            Teysa: You know, I remember what you said about the islands earlier.
            Teysa: Maybe we could enjoy the view together again sometime?
            <<endif>>
        <<endif>>
    -> Keep the Apple
        {$playerName}: Actually, I think I'll hold onto it for now.
        Teysa: Oh...
        Teysa: That's alright.
        Teysa: Let me know if you change your mind.
<<else>>
    Teysa: Hello again, {$playerName}!
    Teysa: Have you had any luck finding an apple?
    {$playerName}: Not yet.
    Teysa: That's alright.
    Teysa: I'm sure you'll find something eventually.
<<endif>>
===
title: TeysaRelationship
---
<<if $teysaAppleQuestComplete == true && $teysaAdmiredIslands == true && get_affection("characterteysa") >= 10>>
    <<set $teysaPositiveInteractionUnlocked = true>>
    <<jump TeysaRelationshipUnlocked>>
<<endif>>
Teysa: Oh! Hello again, {$playerName}.
Teysa: Thank you again for bringing me that apple.
Teysa: I'm feeling much better now.
-> Ask about her alchemy
    {$playerName}: How did you become interested in alchemy?
    Teysa: I've always loved discovering how things work.
    Teysa: Mixing ingredients, testing theories, creating something new...
    Teysa: It's exciting!
    Teysa: Sometimes experiments don't go quite as planned.
    Teysa: But every mistake teaches me something.
    <<jump TeysaRelationship>>
-> Ask about the Child of the Void
    {$playerName}: You mentioned people call you the Child of the Void.
    Teysa: It's a name people gave me because of something that happened to my family.
    Teysa: The effects changed how I look.
    Teysa: People started treating me differently after that.
    Teysa: But I try not to let it stop me from doing what I love.
    <<jump TeysaRelationship>>
-> Leave
    {$playerName}: I'll see you around, Teysa.
    Teysa: Take care!
===
title: TeysaRelationshipUnlocked
---
<<if $teysaPositiveInteractionSeen == true>>
    Teysa: Oh! {$playerName}!
    Teysa: I was hoping I'd see you again.
    Teysa: The view is even nicer when there's someone to share it with.
<<else>>
    Teysa: Hello, {$playerName}!
    Teysa: I was just thinking about you.
    {$playerName}: Really?
    Teysa: Oh! I mean...
    Teysa: I was thinking about how you helped me.
    Teysa: And how you appreciated the islands too.
    Teysa: Anything else you would like to talk about?
<<endif>>
-> Ask about her alchemy
    {$playerName}: How did you become interested in alchemy?
    Teysa: I've always loved discovering how things work.
    Teysa: Mixing ingredients, testing theories, creating something new...
    Teysa: It's exciting!
    Teysa: Sometimes experiments don't go quite as planned.
    Teysa: But every mistake teaches me something.
    <<jump TeysaRelationshipUnlocked>>
-> Ask about the Child of the Void
    {$playerName}: You mentioned people call you the Child of the Void.
    Teysa: It's a name people gave me because of something that happened to my family.
    Teysa: The effects changed how I look.
    Teysa: People started treating me differently after that.
    Teysa: But I try not to let it stop me from doing what I love.
    <<jump TeysaRelationshipUnlocked>>
-> Admire the floating islands together
    <<jump TeysaPositiveInteraction>>
-> Leave
    {$playerName}: I'll see you around, Teysa.
    Teysa: Take care!
    Teysa: And don't forget to eat something yourself!
===

 
title: TeysaPositiveInteraction
---
Teysa: I'm glad you came back.
Teysa: I was hoping we could spend a little time together.
{$playerName}: I'd like that.
Teysa: Look at the islands...
Teysa: Even after everything that's happened, they're still so beautiful.
Teysa: Sometimes I wonder if people see the same things I do.
{$playerName}: What do you mean?
Teysa: People often look at something unfamiliar and immediately assume it's dangerous.
Teysa: But I think unfamiliar things can be wonderful too.
Teysa: I suppose that's why I enjoy alchemy.
Teysa: There's always something new to discover.
Teysa: Can I ask you something?
{$playerName}: Of course.
Teysa: Do you think something can still be beautiful, even if it's different from everything else?
-> Of course. Being different doesn't make something less beautiful
    {$playerName}: Of course.
    {$playerName}: Being different doesn't make something less beautiful.
    Teysa: ...
    Teysa: Thank you.
    Teysa: That means more to me than you might realise.
    <<if $teysaPositiveInteractionSeen == false>>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterteysa" 5>>
    <<endif>>
-> I think everyone deserves to be appreciated
    {$playerName}: I think everyone deserves to be appreciated for who they are.
    Teysa: You really believe that?
    {$playerName}: I do.
    Teysa: I'm glad.
    Teysa: It's nice knowing someone thinks that way.
    <<if $teysaPositiveInteractionSeen == false>>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterteysa" 5>>
    <<endif>>
-> I'm not really sure
    {$playerName}: I haven't really thought about it before.
    Teysa: That's alright.
    Teysa: I suppose it's not an easy question.
<<set $teysaPositiveInteractionSeen = true>>
Teysa: Anyway...
Teysa: Thank you for sitting with me.
{$playerName}: Anytime.
Teysa: I'd like that.
Teysa: Maybe next time I can show you something I've been working on.
===

